# Working repo for Documents\neu — NOT the Pages repo.
#
# WHAT THIS IS FOR. The Pages repo (_deploy) only ever holds the site
# files, and this .gitignore deliberately keeps `memory\` out of it
# because memory\story.md is the complete walkthrough of the game.
# Removing the stray root repo on 2026-08-17 was correct on its own,
# but together those two facts left 3,600 lines of design documentation
# — plus every script in _scripts\ — with no version history and no
# copy anywhere.
#
# This repo covers that gap. It is local-only by design. Add a PRIVATE
# remote when you want an off-machine copy:
#
#     git remote add origin git@github.com:Neudron/neu-workshop.git
#     git push -u origin main
#
# PRIVATE. It contains the walkthrough. A public remote here undoes the
# entire reason memory\ was excluded from the site in the first place.

# ── the Pages clone ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# _deploy is its own git repository with its own history and its own
# remote. Tracking it from here would either nest a repo inside a repo
# or duplicate every shipped file. It needs no backup: it is a clone.
_deploy/

# ── the walkthrough ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# memory/ holds the complete design documentation and the walkthrough
# (memory/story.md, memory/PLAN.md, etc). It must never reach the
# public Pages repo, because the first puzzle is finding the way in.
#
# It is NOT excluded here — that would make the backup script's
# `git add -f memory/` the only thing keeping it tracked, and a
# single forgotten -f would silently lose 3,600 lines of design docs.
# The deploy script's leak check (`^memory/`) prevents it from shipping.
# TO REVERT: add `memory/` to this file and the folder stops tracking.

# ── dependencies and generated output ────────────────────────────
tests/node_modules/
tests/package-lock.json
_scripts/out/

# ── sprite sources ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2.5 MB of Deltarune/Calamity rips that exist only so tiles and frames
# can be cropped out of them. The crops are tracked; the rips are not.
# They are re-downloadable and they are not our work.
img/act4/deltarune/sr-*.png

# ── backups of things this repo now replaces ─────────────────────
# _scripts\orig holds zipped copies of files before they were changed,
# including the stray root .git. Useful on disk, pointless in history.
_scripts/orig/

# ── leftovers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Written by a sandbox that could create files but not delete them.
# Safe to remove by hand.
.git-write-probe

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.orig
